9	/**
10	 * Rejects a create-owner request whose normalized telephone is already used by any other
11	 * owner, before {@link BuildOwner} runs. The request telephone is already normalised to
12	 * digits by {@link RequireOwnerFields}; existing telephones are normalised the same way.
